     "t": "Climate action: India's NDC",
     "items": [
      [
       "b",
       "**National Mission / Climate Action – NDC:** India's climate commitments under the Paris Agreement.",
       "CA #70"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**2015 INDC:** India's 2015 Intended Nationally Determined Contribution (INDC) contained eight goals.",
       "CA #70"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Quantitative targets:** three of the eight goals were quantitative targets.",
       "CA #70"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**The other five concerned:** sustainable lifestyles, cleaner development, adaptation, finance and technology.",
       "CA #70"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Updated First NDC (2022):** strengthened India's 2030 targets and explicitly supported Lifestyle for Environment (LiFE).",
       "CA #70"
      ],
